usage: genesis [-h]
               {doctor,pipeline,pipeline-atac,benchmark,validate,registry,qc,review,metadata,ai,study,scatac,schematic,run,resume,status,issues,resolve,reconcile,serve} ...

Plant sequencing, study execution and evidence-backed curation.

positional arguments:
  {doctor,pipeline,pipeline-atac,benchmark,validate,registry,qc,review,metadata,ai,study,scatac,schematic,run,resume,status,issues,resolve,reconcile,serve}
    pipeline            Run DAP-seq on one sample sheet
    pipeline-atac       Run paired-end bulk ATAC-seq
    benchmark           Plan, run and compare benchmark experiments
    schematic           Generate Genesis workflow illustrations

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
